  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OMVG High Voltage Electricity Interconnection Project (Supplementary Financing)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute towards satisfying the increasing demand for electricity in the region by supplying an additional 1,348 GWh per annum (946 GWh from Kaleta HEPP (in Guinea) and 402 GWh from Sambangalou Hydro Electric Power Plant or about 12% of their electrical energy needs in 2020.</narrative>
  </description>
